            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates a collection using the [Postman Collection v2.1.0 schema format](https://schema.postman.com/collection/json/v2.1.0/draft-07/docs/index.html).\n\n**Note:**\n\nIf you do not include the `workspace` query parameter, the system creates the collection in the oldest personal Internal workspace you own.\n"
        },
